WIRE.md §6.1, §6.7 (DECISIONS 420): `load.text` follows load.dir's link bounds; a path that is a
link whose target resolves outside the declared roots and the project is E7004 ReadOutsideRoots.
-- call --
load.text("lnk.txt")
-- type --
text
-- symlinks --
lnk.txt ../outside/x.txt
-- /outside/x.txt --
outside
-- findings.txt --
error[E7004]  call:1:1
  cannot read lnk.txt: reached through a symbolic link outside the roots and the project

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
